    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const upload = $input.first().json;\nconst source = $(\"Assemble project guidance and source binary\").item.json;\nconst fileId = upload.id;\nif (!fileId) throw new Error(\"OpenAI file upload did not return an id: \" + JSON.stringify(upload));\nconst isPdf = source.mimeType === \"application/pdf\";\nconst filePart = isPdf ? {type:\"input_file\", file_id:fileId} : {type:\"input_image\", file_id:fileId, detail:\"high\"};\nconst instructions = `You are a senior Business Systems Analyst. Analyse the supplied BRD source visually and semantically. Source file: ${source.path}.\nUNIVERSAL BRAND: ${source.universalBrand}\nVOICE: ${source.voice}\nBA STANDARDS: ${source.standards}\nPROJECT OVERRIDE: ${source.projectConfig}\nTEMPLATE: ${source.template}\nCreate a complete FSD as a single self-contained HTML document. Include Document Control; Purpose and Scope; Background and Objectives; BRD Summary; Functional Requirements; Business Rules; Data Requirements; Process Flows; Interfaces and Integrations; Validations and Exception Handling; Non-Functional Requirements; Dependencies and Assumptions; Acceptance Criteria; Requirements Traceability Matrix; Open Questions and BA Decisions. Capture text in diagrams, tables, screenshots and handwritten/scan content only when legible. Do not guess unreadable content. Preserve original requirement IDs. For generated IDs use FR-001, BR-001, DATA-001 and label them generated. Cite source page/section only when identifiable. Missing information must say 'Not specified in BRD \u2013 BA confirmation required'. Clearly label assumptions and recommendations. Do not invent facts. Return valid complete HTML only, no markdown fences. Use A4-friendly CSS and semantic tables. Use the brand palette from guidance; if no actual hex values are configured, use neutral navy/teal defaults and mark palette as pending brand confirmation.`;\nreturn [{json:{request:{model:\"gpt-4.1\",input:[{role:\"user\",content:[{type:\"input_text\",text:instructions},filePart]}],max_output_tokens:16000},sourcePath:source.path,sourceFileName:source.sourceFileName,mimeType:source.mimeType}}];"
      },
      "id": "6ee6f24a-8cf3-42b5-9f90-7573f16d54ad",
